#org @gText_SeafoamIslands_1
[BLACK]An exceedingly powerful force\napproaches[.]

#org @gText_SeafoamIslands_2 
[BLACK][.]

#org @gText_SeafoamIslands_3
[BLACK]It's a [GREEN]Keldeo[BLACK]!

#org @gText_SeafoamIslands_4
[BLACK]Do you confront it?

#org @gText_pryce_1
[BLUE]Why, hello there.\pThe [GREEN]Seafoam Islands[BLUE] is a very\nnostalgic spot for me[.]\pAh, I haven't introduced myself.\pI'm [GREEN]Pryce[BLUE].\pI was once a fearsome Gym Leader,\nbut age has taken its toll.\pHowever, as an elder, I have\nmany lessons to teach.\pPerhaps a challenge is what you\nseek?

#org @gText_pryce_2
Ah, well, I shall continue training\nhere.

#org @gText_pryce_3
Very well.\pHopefully I can demonstrate my\npower!

#org @gText_pryce_Defeat
Impressive[.] It appears you've\novercome many obstacles as well.

#org @gText_pryce_6
I haven't felt that young in ages.\pThank you, challenger.\pI don't have much to give anymore,\nbut perhaps you'd like this.

#org @gText_pryce_7
This keeps me warm during the\nwinter, but it is a useful hold item\lfor Pok\emon as well.

#org @gText_pryce_Take
It's common knowledge that [GREEN]Articuno[BLUE]\nreigns in[GREEN] Seafoam Islands[BLUE], but rumors\lare an additional mythical Pok\emon\lhas made its stay here.\pPerhaps someone capable like you\nwould like to check it out[.]\pAs for me, I'll be heading home.\pThese old bones can't take it\nanymore.\pSo long, challenger.

#org @gText_keldeo_12
Kawwooo!

#org @gText_SeafoamIslands_Articuno_1
Gyaoo!

#org @gText_Seafoam_ASandhrew_1
[.]

#org @gText_Seafoam_ASandshrew_2
[BLACK]This Sandshrew says it'll show\nyou a secret path if you beat it in\la race.\pWould you like to try?

#org @gText_SeafoamIslands_Race_1
Ready[.]

#org @gText_SeafoamIslands_Race_2
Go!

#org @gText_Seafoam_YouLose
It seems Sandshrew beat you.\pIt'll escort you back to the\nstart in case you want to try\lagain.

#org @gText_OhNoFailedRace
It seems you've failed the race.

#org @gText_ReturnToTryAgain
Would you like to try again?

#org @gText_Seafoam_YouWin
You beat the Sandshrew! 

#org @gText_KyogrePrimalOrb
[BLACK]There seems to be an item here[.]

#org @gText_Seafoam_ASandshrew_3
The Sandshrew wishes you good luck.

#org @gText_Seafoam_Pryce1
Ah, good to see you here,\nChampion. I see you made it past\l[GREEN]Sandshrew the Swift.[BLUE]\pI've revisited this area off the hunch\nof that [GREEN]Sandshrew.[BLUE]\pAnother powerful legendary has found\nits place here, one far more\lpowerful than Articuno and even\lKeldeo that are found here.\pHow it got here, I'm not sure[.]\pBut I've stood watch ensuring it does\nnot fall in the wrong hands.\pIf you would like to seek this Pok\emon,\nyou'll have to get through me,\lchild.\pAre you ready?

#org @gText_Seafoam_Pryce2
Huh, not interested in the\nlegendary?\pI'll continue standing guard, then.

#org @gText_pryce_Defeat2
Heh, another cold defeat.

#org @gText_Seafoam_Pryce3
It was an honor to fight the champion\nonce more.\pEven in my old age I can stand my\nground against a majority of Pok\e-\lmon trainers.\pFine, the legendary here is yours.\pAnd please, take this from me.

#org @gText_Seafoam_Pryce4
[BLUE]Take care.

#org @gText_Seafoam_MonsAreFrozen
Pryce's cold demeanor froze some\nof your Pok\emon!
